🏁 🍇
  💭 An empty literal can be of any element type.
  😀 🔡📏🐇🐟 🍿🍆❗️ 10❗️❗️
  😀 🔡📏🐇🐟 🍿 1 2 🍆❗️ 10❗️❗️
